Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.78,Kick,,0,0,0,,ZEPTO · EXPLAINED
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.78,Title,,0,0,0,,REVENUE IS\NNOT PROFIT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:23.78,Foot,,0,0,0,,Sources: Free Press Journal · 5paisa\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}₹22,600 CR REVENUE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Zepto brings in over ₹22,000 crore a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:05.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Yet it was burning cash every quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:06.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Here is why.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:07.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Because revenue isn't profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.61,0:00:09.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Ten minute delivery is expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.37,0:00:16.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}You pay rent for stores in prime locations, you pay riders, and you pay discounts to win customers from Blinkit, Instamart and Amazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:21.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}In the year before, Zepto's losses widened to over three thousand three hundred crore rupees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.95,0:00:23.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}It was burning cash every quarter.
